  ('Will it fix a musty smell from the aircon?', 'It can help, and aircon vent cleaning is part of the process. If the smell returns quickly, the cause may be a blocked drain or a dirty evaporator, which needs servicing. Our sister brand Motoserv can look at that. Tell us when the smell appears, for example when the aircon is first switched on.'),
