  ('Can you maintain a coating that was applied elsewhere?', 'Often, but it depends on the type and condition of the coating, which we cannot judge without seeing it. Book a free assessment and we will tell you honestly whether maintenance will help or the coating has reached the end of its life.'),
  ('What is the difference between a normal wash and maintenance?', 'A normal wash removes dirt. Maintenance also inspects the coating, removes bonded contaminants and water spots, applies KlarSHIELD and finishes with a pure-water rinse. It is aimed at restoring the coating, not only cleaning the car. It is aimed at keeping a coating performing between full treatments.'),
  ('Does maintenance extend the life of a coating?', 'It helps the coating stay within its rated life, which is about 1 to 2 years for KlarCOAT ceramic and up to 3 to 5 years for KlarGRAPHENE with proper maintenance. It does not extend a coating beyond what the product can do.'),
